ons to protect  Ecosystem both India and abroad  secondly we move forward with  preparations to deliver our zero  pollution ambition fitness checks on  Europe's air and water legislation  indicated that legislation in both areas  is working well but that there is still  plenty of room for improvement the  agreement on water between European  Parliament and the council allow us to  address emerging threats like endocrine  disrupters and micro plastics in water  it goes further than standards of World  Health Organization and that's how it's  supposed to be everyone should feel safe  about drinking water  moreover the importance of a new  chemical strategy for sustainability was  also discussed as we must ensure the  toxic-free environment that citizens  deserve it was a day of evaluation and a  day that allowed us to prepare for the  next year when we will deliver on the  way on different actions and initiatives  outlined in the European Green Deal  which will be a true game changer I  would like to truly thank to the Finnish  presidency they did amazing job and they  put environmental agenda very very top  of the council and gender and of course  let me seize the opportunity and wish  you all a very Merry Christmas together  with your families and loved ones thank  you
 

